{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "1CO",
  "chapter": 12,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "1CO.12.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.12.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now concerning spiritual ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "gifts",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", brethren, I would not have you ignorant.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.12.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.12.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Ye know that ye were Gentiles, carried away to these dumb idols, even as ye were led.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.12.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.12.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wherefore I give you to understand, that no man speaking by the Spirit of God, calleth Jesus accursed: and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " no man can say that Jesus is the Lord, but by the Holy Spirit.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.12.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.12.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now there are diversities of gifts, but the same Spirit.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.12.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.12.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And there are differences of administrations, but the same Lord.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.12.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.12.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And there are diversities of operations, but it is the same God who worketh all in all.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.12.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.12.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But the manifestation of the Spirit is given to every man for profit.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.12.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.12.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For to one is given by the Spirit the word of wisdom; to another, the word of knowledge by the same Spirit;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.12.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.12.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To another, faith by the same Spirit; to another, the gifts of healing by the same Spirit;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.12.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.12.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To another, the working of miracles; to another, prophecy; to another, discerning of spirits; to another, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "divers",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " kinds of languages; to another, the interpretation of languages:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.12.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.12.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But all these worketh that one and the same Spirit, dividing to every man severally as he will.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.12.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.12.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For as the body is one, and hath many members, and all the members of that one body, being many, are one body: so also ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Christ.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.12.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.12.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For by one Spirit are we all baptized into one body, whether Jews or Gentiles, whether bond or free; and have been all made to drink into one Spirit.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.12.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.12.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the body is not one member, but many.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.12.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.12.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If the foot shall say, Because I am not the hand, I am not of the body; is it therefore not of the body?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.12.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.12.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And if the ear shall say, Because I am not the eye, I am not of the body; is it therefore not of the body?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.12.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.12.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If the whole body ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " an eye, where ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the hearing? If the whole ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " hearing, where ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the smelling?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.12.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.12.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But now hath God set the members every one of them in the body, as it hath pleased him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.12.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.12.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And if they were all one member, where ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the body?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.12.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.12.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But now ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are they",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " many members, yet but one body.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.12.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.12.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the eye cannot say to the hand, I have no need of thee: nor again the head to the feet, I have no need of you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.12.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.12.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Nay, much more those members of the body, which seem to be more feeble, are necessary:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.12.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.12.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And those ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "members",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of the body, which we think to be less honorable, upon these we bestow more abundant honor; and our uncomely ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "parts",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " have more abundant comeliness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.12.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.12.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For our comely ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "parts",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " have no need: but God hath tempered the body together, having given more abundant honor to that ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "part",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " which lacked:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.12.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.12.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That there should be no schism in the body; but ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the members should have the same care one for another.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.12.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.12.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And thus if one member suffers all the members suffer with it; or, if one member is honored, all the members rejoice with it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.12.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.12.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now ye are the body of Christ, and members in particular.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.12.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.12.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And God hath set some in the church, first apostles, secondly prophets, thirdly teachers, next miracles, then gifts of healings, helps, governments, diversities of languages.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.12.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.12.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " all apostles? ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " all prophets? ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " all teachers? ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " all workers of miracles?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.12.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.12.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Have all the gifts of healing? do all speak in languages? do all interpret?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.12.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.12.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But covet earnestly the best gifts. And yet I show to you a more excellent way.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
